"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴完成800亿港元新股配售，资金将全额投入AI基础设施建设</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dd9a7cae1bb950ed46cb2400cfd64b2f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴于8月24日完成800亿港元（约102亿美元）新股配售定价，所得净额将100%投入全栈AI能力建设与基础设施。本次配售获近3倍超额认购，认购金额超2000亿港元，主权与长线基金认购比例超40%。集团主席蔡崇信与CEO吴泳铭合计增持约1.2亿港元公司股票，以示对AI战略的支持。目前阿里AI相关产品年化收入已突破495亿元人民币，预计下季度达100亿美元。管理层预期2030年阿里云外部收入将达千亿美元，利润率达20%，AI资本开支预计在2至3年内收回。此次融资标志着阿里正加速从算力、芯片向模型与应用的全栈布局，通过资本投入强化其在AI领域的竞争壁垒。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达洽谈投资AI搜索公司Perplexity，估值超300亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a7146217b1576a69182e9a05b03a722c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正洽谈投资AI搜索公司Perplexity，交易对应估值超300亿美元，较一年前增长逾50%。Perplexity年化收入已从2.5亿美元增至超7.5亿美元，增长核心驱动力包括AI代理“Perplexity Computer”的推出，该代理支持自动执行多步骤任务，其高Token消耗进一步推高了收入。Perplexity此前已加入英伟达Nemotron联盟，并计划于2028年前后推进IPO。英伟达近期通过资本布局强化AI产业链，除Perplexity外，还涉及Poolside、Groq及Enfabrica等企业。通过投资AI基础设施与应用公司，英伟达旨在扩大AI生态影响力，并促进GPU等产品采购的收入回流。随着AI应用向Agent演进，英伟达正通过算力与资本双重布局，巩固其在AI产业链的核心地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">法律AI独角兽Harvey基于月之暗面Kimi K3模型推出Tenet</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/34f8ec0f302b1149813b1236ad1a3431.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美国法律AI独角兽Harvey正式宣布，基于月之暗面（Moonshot AI）开放权重模型Kimi K3，通过后训练技术开发出法律专用模型Harvey Tenet。这是中国开放权重模型首次进入美国头部垂直AI公司的训练体系。Harvey此前主要依赖OpenAI与Anthropic等闭源模型，服务全球超2400家机构及20多万名律师。作为估值达110亿美元的行业头部企业，Harvey此次从闭源依赖转向采用中国开源底座，标志着开放权重模型在法律等高门槛垂直赛道已获得实质性信任。该模型落地不仅验证了Kimi K3的技术能力，也为中国开源模型出海提供了重要范式，显示出高性能开源底座在国际专业化应用场景中的竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceX AI旗下Grok Build集成Browser-Use插件，实现浏览器自动化控制</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b2713b9bed5394a327bf18f3bba64c64.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceX AI近日宣布为Grok Build平台新增Browser-Use插件，使AI具备直接调用浏览器进行复杂交互的能力。该插件支持调用本地Chrome浏览器（无需API密钥）或隔离的云端浏览器环境，显著提升了Grok在网页自动化领域的应用边界。在功能层面，Grok Build现可自主完成网页浏览、数据抓取、表单填写、网页应用自动化测试及屏幕截图等任务。开发者可通过uvx在本地直接运行该工具，快速构建网页自动化工作流。此次更新标志着Grok向全栈网页智能助手迈出关键一步，通过打通AI与网页交互的物理壁垒，大幅简化了自动化任务的执行流程，为用户提供更高效的网页操作体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI推出ChatGPT自定义贴纸功能，支持导出至iMessage和WhatsApp</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/57fe8bf08fd99fe060fb710f54e6aa19.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式上线ChatGPT自定义贴纸功能，用户可将照片、创意想法或文字提示转化为个性化贴纸，并直接导出至iMessage、WhatsApp或保存至手机相册。该功能支持生成透明背景贴纸，并允许用户创建完整贴纸包。用户可通过上传图片、重新组合素材、视觉风格迁移或文字描述来定制设计。ChatGPT在生成过程中具备智能抠图与图像修复能力，可补全被裁剪的人物部分。导出流程上，用户点击“添加到聊天应用”即可完成操作，其中WhatsApp导出需满足至少3个贴纸的平台限制。生成的贴纸在iMessage中将归类于ChatGPT专属区域。此次更新标志着ChatGPT从单一文本与图像创作工具，向社交内容创作及日常沟通场景的深度融合，为用户提供了更具个性化的交互体验。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
